{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123018","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123018/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123018/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123018/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123018","id":5296371948,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBjW6sQ","number":123018,"title":"Fix spawn packet size check overflow allowing OOB read","user":{"login":"binarycurious","id":91041518,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxMDQxNTE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91041518?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/binarycurious","html_url":"https://github.com/binarycurious","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binarycurious/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binarycurious/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binarycurious/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binarycurious/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binarycurious/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binarycurious/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binarycurious/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binarycurious/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binarycurious/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6051509301,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaLK0NQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/spam","name":"spam","color":"E94A26","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-08-31T04:17:53Z","updated_at":"2026-08-31T10:41:18Z","closed_at":"2026-08-31T08:55:54Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":"spam","draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123018","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123018","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123018.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123018.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"\r\n\r\n`SceneReplicationInterface::on_spawn_receive()` validated the spawn packet length with `name_len + (sync_len * 4)` evaluated in 32-bit math. Because `sync_len` is an attacker-controlled `uint32_t` read straight from the packet, the product wraps: `0x40000001 * 4 == 4`. The bounds check then passes for a minimally sized packet, and the following loop iterates `sync_len` times reading 4 bytes per iteration, walking far past the end of the buffer.\r\n\r\nThe comparison is now done in signed 64-bit, where the operands cannot overflow across their full input range. This also bounds the number of sync ids to the packet size, so a single 4-byte field can no longer drive unbounded `List<uint32_t>` allocation.\r\n\r\nReachable by any connected peer that is the authority of a `MultiplayerSpawner`, and by a malicious server against clients.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123018/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123018/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}